是的，他们需要一些群演。

1677
01:15:30.270 --> 01:15:34.490
And speaking of that, Oscar, did you audition for the role of an accountant?
他们给了我一些台词，都是些普通的办公室内容。

1678
01:15:34.890 --> 01:15:36.310
Yes, they needed extra people.
好的。

1679
01:15:36.530 --> 01:15:40.690
They gave me copy to read, and it was a general office stuff.
我的经纪人布鲁斯说，这是为《办公室》试镜。

1680
01:15:40.950 --> 01:15:41.130
Okay.
我说，听起来不错。

1681
01:15:41.310 --> 01:15:43.730
And my manager, Bruce, is like, it's for the office.
我很喜欢英版《办公室》，但我当时想，我们就拍个试播集，反正也不会被续订。

1682
01:15:43.730 --> 01:15:45.570
And I'm like, well, that sounds good.
我当时就是这种感觉。

1683
01:15:45.570 --> 01:15:51.950
And I love the British office, but I thought, we'll do the pilot, and it won't get picked
我非常怀疑。

1684
01:15:51.950 --> 01:15:52.130
up.
我想我们当时都有这种感觉。

1685
01:15:52.290 --> 01:15:53.050
That was my feeling.
我当时已经不抱什么希望了。

1686
01:15:53.170 --> 01:15:55.090
I was so skeptical.
但我很喜欢这部剧。

1687
01:15:55.410 --> 01:15:56.970
I think we all felt that way.
我很喜欢瑞奇·热维斯。

1688
01:15:56.970 --> 01:15:57.810
I was so over it.
我当时想，哦，这剧很棒，但我们肯定拍不出那种精髓。

1689
01:15:57.910 --> 01:15:59.190
But I love the show.
我当时就是这么想的。

1690
01:15:59.290 --> 01:16:00.230
I love the Ricky Gervais.
我们拍不出那种精髓。

1691
01:16:00.370 --> 01:16:02.190
I'm like, oh, it's great, but we're not going to do it justice.
别太兴奋，奥斯卡。

1692
01:16:02.390 --> 01:16:02.990
That's what I was thinking.
别太兴奋。

1693
01:16:03.070 --> 01:16:03.910
We're not going to do justice.
我觉得我表现得好就是因为我不在乎。

1694
01:16:04.070 --> 01:16:05.150
Don't get excited, Oscar.
然后他们说，好吧，来参加复试吧。

1695
01:16:05.270 --> 01:16:05.850
Don't get excited.
复试的时候，我想那应该是有剧本的。

1696
01:16:06.530 --> 01:16:09.310
And I think that's why I did well, because I didn't care.
但我去了，我想大概去了三次，至少三次吧。

1697
01:16:09.310 --> 01:16:13.690
And then they're like, well, let's come in for a callback.
最后一次是即兴表演。

1698
01:16:14.130 --> 01:16:17.590
And then the callback, I think it must have been scripted.
我们当时真的不知道，没听过八卦，也没看过相关文件。

1699
01:16:17.750 --> 01:16:21.090
But I went in, I think, three times, or maybe three for sure.
我们俩走进片场，在服装间碰面，我问他，你怎么在这儿？

1700
01:16:21.470 --> 01:16:23.210
And then the last one was improv.
他问我，你怎么在这儿？

1701
01:16:23.470 --> 01:16:27.290
And I was like, okay, I really like this, because I can improv, because I was literally
当时我就想，好吧，我真的很喜欢这个，因为我可以即兴发挥，因为我当时真的是

1702
01:16:27.290 --> 01:16:28.130
in the ground lines at that.
在做那些基础台词。

1703
01:16:28.550 --> 01:16:33.670
So I improv'd for the live long day, and I had a really good time and tried to keep it
所以我整天都在即兴发挥，玩得很开心，并尽量保持

1704
01:16:33.670 --> 01:16:35.270
close to the vest and not go too crazy.
克制，不要太疯狂。

1705
01:16:36.190 --> 01:16:39.490
And then my manager called and said, you got it.
然后我的经纪人打电话来说，你被选上了。

1706
01:16:39.550 --> 01:16:42.510
And I got a little bit more excited, but still did not quit my day job.
我当时兴奋了一点，但还是没辞掉我的日常工作。

1707
01:16:42.870 --> 01:16:50.130
I was catering and babysitting and did not quit until we got picked up for the season.
我当时在做餐饮服务和保姆，直到我们确定被续订一整季才辞职。

1708
01:16:50.290 --> 01:16:52.410
And then Flannery and I quit at the same time.
然后弗兰纳里和我同时辞职了。

1709
01:16:52.530 --> 01:16:53.010
We looked at each other.
我们看着对方。

1710
01:16:53.130 --> 01:16:53.450
We're like, now?
我们心想，现在吗？

1711
01:16:53.570 --> 01:16:54.110
And she's like, now?
她说，现在吗？

1712
01:16:54.590 --> 01:16:54.850
Yeah.
是的。

1713
01:16:56.430 --> 01:16:57.170
Let's do it now.
现在就辞吧。

1714
01:16:57.370 --> 01:16:58.330
I'm like, all right, let's do it.
我说，好吧，那就辞吧。

1715
01:16:58.410 --> 01:16:59.070
And we both quit.
于是我们俩都辞职了。

1716
01:16:59.170 --> 01:17:00.610
We're like, free falling.
我们当时感觉就像，自由落体一样。

1717
01:17:01.490 --> 01:17:04.350
You quit catering and babysitting.
你辞掉了餐饮和保姆的工作。

1718
01:17:04.350 --> 01:17:05.810
And Kate quit being a waitress.
凯特也辞掉了服务员的工作。

1719
01:17:05.810 --> 01:17:06.190
That's right.
没错。

1720
01:17:06.190 --> 01:17:08.970
And her lovely manager said, everyone wished her well.
她那位可爱的经纪人说，大家都祝她一切顺利。

1721
01:17:09.030 --> 01:17:10.750
And her manager said, you'll be back.
但她的经纪人却说，你会回来的。

1722
01:17:11.050 --> 01:17:13.250
She's like, oh, thank you for that.
她当时心想，哦，谢谢你的吉言。

1723
01:17:14.410 --> 01:17:16.390
All right, let's talk about this scene.
好了，我们来聊聊这场戏。

1724
01:17:16.650 --> 01:17:17.250
All right, Oscar.
好的，奥斯卡。

1725
01:17:17.570 --> 01:17:22.430
This is the scene where Michael starts by offering to hug you.
这场戏是迈克尔一开始提出要拥抱你。

1726
01:17:23.110 --> 01:17:24.570
You know, you're upset.
你知道，你当时很心烦。

1727
01:17:24.570 --> 01:17:25.790
You're like, I'm out of here.
你当时想，我要离开这儿。

1728
01:17:25.950 --> 01:17:29.910
And Michael's like, come on, I'm going to give you a hug in an attempt to show that
然后迈克尔说，来吧，我要给你一个拥抱，试图表现出

1729
01:17:29.910 --> 01:17:33.150
he's totally OK with Oscar being gay.
他完全接受奥斯卡是同性恋的事实。

1730
01:17:33.150 --> 01:17:40.190
But this ended up with Steve kissing you on the lips, which was not scripted.
但最终史蒂夫亲了你的嘴唇，这并不是剧本里写的。

1731
01:17:41.550 --> 01:17:46.210
Well, it's crazy because Michael, like, completely offends you.
嗯，这很疯狂，因为迈克尔完全冒犯了你。

1732
01:17:46.210 --> 01:17:48.290
And you're like, you feel insulted.
你当时觉得，你受到了侮辱。

1733
01:17:48.370 --> 01:17:49.670
You want to leave.
你想离开。

1734
01:17:50.070 --> 01:17:53.850
Then you realize you've broken Michael's heart.
然后你意识到你伤了迈克尔的心。

1735
01:17:54.010 --> 01:17:55.450
And so you're like, OK, buddy, come here.
所以你心想，好吧，伙计，过来吧。

1736
01:17:55.570 --> 01:17:58.250
Now you're comforting Michael.
现在轮到你安慰迈克尔了。

1737
01:17:58.250 --> 01:18:00.530
And he's like tearing up.
他当时快要哭了。

1738
01:18:00.730 --> 01:18:03.950
It's just like, you're becoming his parent in the moment.
就像是，那一刻你成了他的家长。

1739
01:18:04.570 --> 01:18:07.710
None of this should be happening in a workplace.
这些事都不应该发生在工作场所。

1740
01:18:08.210 --> 01:18:08.530
No.
没错。

1741
01:18:09.230 --> 01:18:12.090
Well, Oscar, I have the script from Gay Witch Hunt.
嗯，奥斯卡，我有《同性恋猎巫行动》的剧本。

1742
01:18:12.430 --> 01:18:13.830
And I looked it up.
我查了一下。

1743
01:18:13.950 --> 01:18:15.450
And here is what was originally scripted.
这是最初剧本里的内容。

1744
01:18:15.490 --> 01:18:16.010
Because I was curious.
因为我很好奇。

1745
01:18:16.030 --> 01:18:18.710
Because I knew that what ended up airing was an improv.
因为我知道最终播出的版本是即兴发挥的。

1746
01:18:18.710 --> 01:18:28.490
So originally he hugs you and then he was supposed to go in for a kiss, but he chickens out and
所以最初他拥抱你，然后本该凑过去亲你，但他退缩了，

1747
01:18:28.490 --> 01:18:31.210
is supposed to, like, kiss you on the forehead or something.
本该亲你的额头之类的。

1748
01:18:31.730 --> 01:18:34.590
But I remember sitting in that room.
但我记得当时坐在那个房间里。

1749
01:18:34.630 --> 01:18:40.050
And when Steve said the line, I want you to burn this into your brains.
当史蒂夫说那句台词时，我想让你们把这一幕深深印在脑海里。

1750
01:18:40.730 --> 01:18:41.890
That was the moment.
就是那一刻。

1751
01:18:41.890 --> 01:18:43.230
We knew that was improv.
我们知道那是即兴发挥。

1752
01:18:43.710 --> 01:18:45.250
Yeah, that was an improv line.
没错，那是一句即兴台词。

1753
01:18:46.170 --> 01:18:48.790
What does Steve have in his head right now?
史蒂夫当时脑子里在想什么呢？

1754
01:18:49.410 --> 01:18:55.390
And Oscar, to me as an audience member, and I'm saying audience member, like, because I was.
还有奥斯卡，对我这个观众来说——我强调是观众，因为我当时确实是。

1755
01:18:55.390 --> 01:18:57.890
I was just sitting in the conference room as an audience member.
我当时就坐在会议室里，以观众的身份看着。

1756
01:18:58.310 --> 01:19:03.710
That line was the moment when I knew we had taken a turn on to a totally new road.
那句台词就是我知道我们走上一条全新道路的时刻。

1757
01:19:03.890 --> 01:19:04.870
What was it for you?
对你来说呢？

1758
01:19:05.070 --> 01:19:08.510
Do you remember, like, when you were like, wait, what's going on?
你还记得吗，就是那种“等等，发生什么了？”的感觉？

1759
01:19:08.510 --> 01:19:10.470
I've had time to process it.
我已经有时间消化这件事了。

1760
01:19:10.570 --> 01:19:14.650
But at the moment, I think we did three or four takes.
但在当时，我想我们拍了三四条吧。

1761
01:19:15.110 --> 01:19:15.830
Not a lot.
没拍多少次。

1762
01:19:15.950 --> 01:19:16.350
With hugging.
就是拥抱那段。

1763
01:19:16.490 --> 01:19:17.610
With that, the way you're saying.
就是你刚才说的那种方式。

1764
01:19:18.310 --> 01:19:19.130
With the hugging.
就是那个拥抱。

1765
01:19:20.110 --> 01:19:27.610
And then, and then this particular take, he's coming in and I'm like, oh, he's going to,
然后，就在这一条里，他靠过来，我心想，哦，他要……

1766
01:19:27.650 --> 01:19:28.890
he really caught me off guard.
他真的让我措手不及。

1767
01:19:29.530 --> 01:19:33.690
He's coming in closer and closer and his nose is getting closer to my nose.
他越靠越近，鼻子都快碰到我的鼻子了。

1768
01:19:34.550 --> 01:19:38.030
And I'm thinking, I'm thinking, well, I don't know what's happening.
我当时心想，我不知道要发生什么。

1769
01:19:38.030 --> 01:19:40.010
So I'm just going to stand here because he's going to hug me.
所以我只能站在那儿，因为他要抱我。

1770
01:19:40.190 --> 01:19:42.070
And I'm thinking, pick a side.
我当时在想，选一边啊。

1771
01:19:42.250 --> 01:19:44.790
You know, when you hug someone, Jenna, you have to go left or right.
你知道的，珍娜，拥抱的时候，你得选左边或者右边。

1772
01:19:45.750 --> 01:19:46.090
Yeah.
没错。

1773
01:19:46.210 --> 01:19:49.070
And I'm like, pick a side, pick a side, pick a side.
我心里一直在想，选一边，选一边，选一边。

1774
01:19:49.130 --> 01:19:50.770
And I'm like, oh no, he's not picking a side.
然后我心想，糟了，他没选边。

1775
01:19:51.210 --> 01:19:51.870
He's this close.
他靠得这么近。

1776
01:19:51.890 --> 01:19:54.050
I'm like, I'm like, he's not picking a side.
我心想，他没选边。

1777
01:19:54.190 --> 01:19:57.550
And then he came in for a sweet, sweet kiss and our lips touched.
然后他凑过来亲了一下，甜甜的一吻，我们的嘴唇碰到了。

1778
01:19:57.730 --> 01:20:01.350
And then that's when like this laugh came from my stomach and I stopped it.
就在那一刻，我肚子里涌出一阵笑意，但我忍住了。

1779
01:20:01.350 --> 01:20:04.710
And I also heard a lot of giggling and snickering from the peanut gallery.
我还听到围观群众席那边传来一阵窃笑和偷笑声。

1780
01:20:05.030 --> 01:20:08.270
And I'm like, oh, I hope the camera's, well, it doesn't matter.
我心想，哦，希望摄像机……算了，无所谓了。

1781
01:20:08.350 --> 01:20:09.530
Cause that's the reaction.
因为这就是真实的反应。

1782
01:20:09.650 --> 01:20:10.750
Whatever's happening is happening.
发生什么就是什么吧。

1783
01:20:11.790 --> 01:20:14.330
And then he stopped kissing me and I'm like, okay, stay in character.
然后他停止了亲吻，我心想，好吧，保持角色。

1784
01:20:14.510 --> 01:20:15.790
And I'm like, I said, thank you.
我当时说，谢谢你。

1785
01:20:15.850 --> 01:20:16.810
I think, I don't know why.
我想，我也不知道为什么。

1786
01:20:23.760 --> 01:20:27.260
Where, well, first of all, you improvise a great line, Oscar, where you're like,
首先，奥斯卡，你即兴发挥了一句很棒的台词，你说……

1787
01:20:27.380 --> 01:20:28.900
we don't have to do this.
我们没必要这么做。

1788
01:20:28.900 --> 01:20:30.080
And he's like, yes, we do.
然后他说，不，我们必须这么做。

1789
01:20:31.220 --> 01:20:32.060
Yes, we do.
我们必须这么做。

1790
01:20:32.280 --> 01:20:36.820
And then after he improvised the slide where he was like, there, I did it.
然后在他即兴发挥完那句“好了，我做到了”之后。

1791
01:20:36.980 --> 01:20:37.980
Like, he's the hero.
就像他是英雄一样。

1792
01:20:38.140 --> 01:20:38.960
And we're still here.
而我们还在这儿。

1793
01:20:39.200 --> 01:20:40.100
We're still here.
我们还在这儿。

1794
01:20:40.420 --> 01:20:40.920
I know.
我知道。

1795
01:20:41.100 --> 01:20:41.920
He's the hero.
他是英雄。

1796
01:20:42.160 --> 01:20:42.920
He did it.
他做到了。

1797
01:20:43.040 --> 01:20:43.620
He did it.
他做到了。

1798
01:20:43.680 --> 01:20:46.620
He dragged me out of the closet where I was perfectly happy.
他把我从壁橱里拽了出来，而我本来在那儿待得挺开心的。

1799
01:20:46.880 --> 01:20:50.240
Well, the thing that amazes me is that when you see all of our reactions,
最让我惊讶的是，当你看到我们所有人的反应时，

1800
01:20:50.660 --> 01:20:53.020
we were just reacting in real time.
我们当时真的都是即时反应。

1801
01:20:53.120 --> 01:20:53.400
I know.
我知道。

1802
01:20:53.500 --> 01:20:57.700
And yet we also are seem to be reacting in character, except for BJ.
然而我们似乎也都在按角色性格做出反应，除了BJ。

1803
01:20:57.700 --> 01:21:02.460
BJ, I'll tell you, BJ turns away in that moment when he's sitting next to me
BJ，我跟你说，BJ坐在我旁边时，他在那一刻转过头去，

1804
01:21:02.460 --> 01:21:03.760
because he started laughing.
因为他笑场了。

1805
01:21:04.500 --> 01:21:07.920
He, the reason he turned away was because he lost it.
他，他转过头的原因是他没忍住。

1806
01:21:08.140 --> 01:21:08.240
Good.
很好。

1807
01:21:08.380 --> 01:21:09.080
He lost it.
他没忍住。

1808
01:21:09.260 --> 01:21:11.580
And then the camera cuts, so you can't see it.
然后镜头切走了，所以你看不见。

1809
01:21:11.660 --> 01:21:12.400
No, Karel's insane.
不，卡雷尔疯了。

1810
01:21:12.620 --> 01:21:14.280
I covered my face because I was laughing.
我捂住脸是因为我在笑。

1811
01:21:14.500 --> 01:21:18.740
And I thought, okay, hopefully this tracks that Angela Martin wouldn't want to see it
我当时想，好吧，希望这能解释安吉拉·马丁为什么不想看，

1812
01:21:18.740 --> 01:21:21.620
because I'm laughing and I don't want to ruin this moment.
因为我在笑，我不想毁了这个时刻。

1813
01:21:21.940 --> 01:21:22.220
Oh, my God.
天哪。

1814
01:21:22.420 --> 01:21:23.900
Thank goodness Jenna was the closest to us or one of the closeSt.
谢天谢地，珍娜离我们最近，或者说是最近的人之一。

1815
01:21:24.060 --> 01:21:24.880
She was like right there.
她就在那儿。

1816
01:21:24.880 --> 01:21:28.340
Well, Oscar, I don't know if you remember, but you and I were doing an interview together.
嗯，奥斯卡，我不知道你还记不记得，但你和我当时正在一起接受采访。

1817
01:21:28.500 --> 01:21:28.880
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1818
01:21:28.940 --> 01:21:29.740
I don't know where we were.
我不记得我们在哪儿了。

1819
01:21:29.840 --> 01:21:33.080
We were doing a press junket for NBC and someone asked you about the moment.
我们当时在为NBC做新闻发布会，有人问起你那个时刻。

1820
01:21:33.220 --> 01:21:37.020
And I'll never forget because I remember it because you cursed.
我永远不会忘记，因为我记得你当时骂人了。

1821
01:21:37.600 --> 01:21:38.880
And I was like, I know we're on camera.
我当时心想，我知道我们在录像。

1822
01:21:39.000 --> 01:21:42.300
But you said something like, then all of a sudden Steve keeps coming closer.
但你说了类似这样的话：突然间，史蒂夫不断靠近。

1823
01:21:42.320 --> 01:21:44.580
And I'm like, son of a bitch.
我心想，该死。

1824
01:21:44.760 --> 01:21:45.940
He's going to kiss me.
他要亲我了。

1825
01:21:47.360 --> 01:21:51.360
That you had this moment where you knew it was past the point of no return.
你当时就知道已经到了无法挽回的地步。

1826
01:21:51.360 --> 01:21:52.120
It's happening.
要发生了。

1827
